{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/898460/extras/3392c50715476e04a7c9228d6f39d786.webp?t=1759925913\" width=600 height=50 /></span>Outback is an end of the world survival game set in Tasmania Australia.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a harsh environment and staying alive is  a challenge. However, it gets worse because the world is ending.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck staying alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/898460/extras/c4040bf270b9e2fd9b1e2441631306cf.webp?t=1759925913\" width=600 height=50 /></span>The features currently supported are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tBase building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tCrafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tCombat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tCustomizable user interface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tFull gamepad controller support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tCustomizable key binds for gamepad controllers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tCustomizable key binds for mouse and keyboard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tLanguage support for 15 different languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/898460/extras/6ca3373d254c8f1a5f06b198a55f8b75.webp?t=1759925913\" width=600 height=50 /></span>This game has a traditional survival crafting experience.  Players can hunt iconic Australian animals for food. However, be careful when exploring. Australian wildlife is known for being deadly and snakes are difficult to see.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, players will need to fight as the wildlife isn't the only threat they will face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/898460/extras/dfeeb602b740c148608dcf2861b38fcd.webp?t=1759925913\" width=600 height=50 /></span>Wafflesoft is an Australian based independent game studio. This is a solo project. This is my first project. Don't worry though this is a good thing. I am able to make choices that improve this game without interference.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"dc76cf75071a4d6e7b805acfba7199dadb55940b.jpg","localized_name":"Survivor","name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/898460/dc76cf75071a4d6e7b805acfba7199dadb55940b.jpg"},{"icon":"a8fda29ca71ccc1693346cc7bff9e4690c0f5cf7.jpg","localized_name":"Survivor 2.0","name":"Survivor 2.0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/898460/a8fda29ca71ccc1693346cc7bff9e4690c0f5cf7.jpg"},{"icon":"214416e53a37bcc958508d2fa545813f0382389e.jpg","localized_name":"Survival Master","name":"Survival Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/898460/214416e53a37bcc958508d2fa545813f0382389e.jpg"},{"icon":"9db3e2611600bb0a9f0be5c8fce53a208016903b.jpg","localized_name":"Golden Glove","name":"Golden Glove","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/898460/9db3e2611600bb0a9f0be5c8fce53a208016903b.jpg"},{"icon":"d705367d50ad6b90f363d051b34d9040c2c3b8dc.jpg","localized_name":"Dangerous Fauna","name":"Dangerous Fauna","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/898460/d705367d50ad6b90f363d051b34d9040c2c3b8dc.jpg"},{"icon":"977941d87da806dc1d11c5081e86e7abf5055d0e.jpg","localized_name":"Defender","name":"Defender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/898460/977941d87da806dc1d11c5081e86e7abf5055d0e.jpg"},{"icon":"d167c830e9dad9180a7ba648757233028ecef86a.jpg","localized_name":"Strategic Defender","nam